* PocketSpice Reusable Power Electronics & Analog Device Library
* Include in any project netlist via: .include power_devices.lib

* Unidirectional IGBT + Antiparallel Diode (Collector c, Emitter e, Gate g)
* Conducts c->e when V(g) > 2.5V; antiparallel diode conducts e->c.
.subckt IGBT_DIODE c e g
S_sw c e g 0 SW_IGBT_STD
D_fw e c D_BODY_STD
R_snub c e 1e5
.model SW_IGBT_STD SW(Ron=5e-3 Roff=1e6 Vt=2.5 Vh=-0.2)
.model D_BODY_STD D(Is=1e-6 Rs=5e-3 N=1.08 Cjo=100p)
.ends IGBT_DIODE

* Back-to-Back Bidirectional Common-Collector IGBT Pair (Nodes a, b, Gate g)
* Blocks both polarities when V(g) < 2.5V; conducts bidirectionally when V(g) > 2.5V.
.subckt BIDIR_IGBT a b g
X_a mid a g IGBT_DIODE
X_b mid b g IGBT_DIODE
.ends BIDIR_IGBT

* Power MOSFET Switch with Body Diode (Drain d, Source s, Gate g)
.subckt MOSFET_SW d s g
S_ch d s g 0 SW_MOS_STD
D_bd s d D_MOS_BODY
R_ds_leak d s 1e6
.model SW_MOS_STD SW(Ron=0.03 Roff=1e6 Vt=2.5 Vh=-0.2)
.model D_MOS_BODY D(Is=2e-6 Rs=0.03 N=1.08 Cjo=150p)
.ends MOSFET_SW

* Near-Ideal Fast Recovery Power Diode (Anode a, Cathode k)
.subckt POWER_DIODE a k
D_p a k D_PWR_STD
.model D_PWR_STD D(Is=2e-6 Rs=0.02 N=1.05 Cjo=80p)
.ends POWER_DIODE
